<%# locals: (task:, agents:, events: nil, mascot: nil) %>
<%#
  The CONSOLIDATED stage timeline for /tasks/:id — one panel that replaces the
  separate "Stage Crew" and "Stage Timeline" boxes. Each completed TRANSITION is
  rendered as a self-contained CARD in a responsive grid (cards side by side,
  wrapping in chronological reading order). Every card carries the same anatomy:
  the stage transition (from → to), the agent(s) that handled it (the build-lane
  mascot · the two senior reviewers · Steffon at QA · Avi at ship), a uniform
  Model / Tokens / Cost / Duration metric block, and a Started → Completed footer.
  When the task is still live, a trailing IN-PROGRESS card shows who is on the
  current stage right now with a green live ticker.

  Cards are wide enough for the two-avatar crew case (the senior review pair, e.g.
  Carl PRIMARY + Shannon LIGHT). Usage is best-effort per transition — any metric the
  agent did not report renders as an em dash (—) so the gap is visible, not hidden.
  Started = when the FROM stage was entered (occurred_at − measured seconds);
  Completed = when it transitioned (occurred_at). The live card shows Started only.

  Source: StageAgentsHelper#stage_timeline reads the task's TaskEvents (transitions
  + open intents) and resolves each card's crew. The live ticker reuses the board's
  window.elapsedLabel formatter.
%>
<% blocks = stage_timeline(task, agents, events: events, mascot: mascot) %>
<div class="bg-surface-alt rounded-lg p-3 mb-4" data-test="stage-timeline">
  <div class="mb-3">
    <p class="label-upper">Stage Timeline</p>
    <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-1">Who handled each stage, the time it took (measured), and the model / tokens / cost reported (best-effort) — plus who's on it right now. <span class="text-secondary font-medium">&mdash;</span> means the agent didn't report that metric.</p>

    <%# Sizing trio — Avi's PO forecast (default sizer, set at creation) · the
        builder's Dev estimate (stamped at claim) · the auto-derived Actual (from
        measured tokens at ship). Em dash for any size not set yet; an amber
        "≠ forecast" flag when the measured Actual diverges from Avi's PO forecast. %>
    <% if [task.po_size, task.dev_size, task.actual_size].any?(&:present?) %>
      <% size_miss = task.po_size.present? && task.actual_size.present? && task.po_size != task.actual_size %>
      <div class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 text-xs" data-test="timeline-sizing">
        <span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wide text-muted mr-0.5">Sizing</span>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-subtle bg-surface" title="Avi's product-owner forecast, set at task creation">
          <span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wide text-muted">Avi · PO</span>
          <span class="font-mono font-semibold uppercase text-secondary"><%= task.po_size.presence&.upcase || "—" %></span>
        </span>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-subtle bg-surface" title="The builder's estimate, stamped when it claimed the task">
          <span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wide text-muted">Dev</span>
          <span class="font-mono font-semibold uppercase text-secondary"><%= task.dev_size.presence&.upcase || "—" %></span>
        </span>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border <%= size_miss ? "border-yellow-500/40 bg-yellow-500/10" : "border-subtle bg-surface" %>"
              title="<%= size_miss ? "Auto-derived from measured usage — differs from Avi's forecast" : "Auto-derived from measured usage at ship" %>">
          <span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wide <%= size_miss ? "text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400" : "text-muted" %>">Actual</span>
          <span class="font-mono font-semibold uppercase <%= size_miss ? "text-yellow-700 dark:text-yellow-300" : "text-secondary" %>"><%= task.actual_size.presence&.upcase || "—" %></span>
        </span>
        <% if size_miss %>
          <span class="text-[10px] text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400" title="Measured actual size differs from Avi's PO forecast">&ne; forecast</span>
        <% end %>
      </div>
    <% end %>
  </div>

  <% if blocks.present? %>
    <%= render "components/elapsed_label_script" %>
    <ol class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3 2xl:grid-cols-4 gap-3" data-test="timeline-grid">
      <% blocks.each do |block| %>
        <% started_at = (block.occurred_at && block.seconds) ? block.occurred_at - block.seconds : nil %>
        <li class="relative isolate flex flex-col bg-surface rounded-lg p-3 border <%= block.in_progress? ? "border-green-400/50" : "border-subtle" %>"
            data-test="timeline-block" data-stage="<%= block.to_stage %>" data-in-progress="<%= block.in_progress? %>">
          <% if block.in_progress? %>
            <%# Live-work indicator: a soft green tint PULSING behind the card content
                (replaces the old "in progress" pill — the duration ticker tells the
                rest). isolate + -z-10 keep it above the card's own background but
                beneath every content layer, so only the backdrop pulses. %>
            <span aria-hidden="true" data-test="timeline-pulse"
                  class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-10 rounded-lg bg-green-500/15 animate-pulse"></span>
          <% end %>

          <%# 1 — stage transition, centered. Deploy-lane live intent cards show only
              the active stage badge until the transition lands; build-lane live work
              is different because `building` is the intent stage, so its existing
              →Building transition stays visible while the card ticks live. %>
          <% show_to_badge = !block.in_progress? || block.event.present? %>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-2 mb-3" data-test="timeline-transition">
            <%= render "components/badge", text: block.from_label, scheme: block.from_stage.present? ? stage_scheme(block.from_stage) : "neutral" %>
            <% if show_to_badge %>
              <span class="text-muted text-xs">&rarr;</span>
              <%= render "components/badge", text: block.to_label, scheme: stage_scheme(block.to_stage) %>
              <% if block.backfilled %>
                <span class="text-[10px] text-muted uppercase tracking-wide" title="Reconstructed from legacy stage timestamps">reconstructed</span>
              <% end %>
            <% end %>
          </div>

          <%# 2 — crew: one discrete column per agent — avatar OVER name (+ review
              weight), each column center-justified. A review PAIR splits into two
              equal 50% columns, each agent centered in its own half; a single agent
              stays one centered column. %>
          <% crew_layout = block.agents.size == 2 ? "grid grid-cols-2" : "flex flex-wrap justify-center" %>
          <div class="<%= crew_layout %> items-start gap-x-4 gap-y-3 mb-3 min-h-[4rem]" data-test="timeline-crew" data-crew-count="<%= block.agents.size %>">
            <% if block.agents.present? %>
              <% block.agents.each do |entry| %>
                <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5 min-w-0 text-center" data-test="timeline-crew-member"
                     title="<%= [entry.name, (entry.role_label.presence && "(#{entry.role_label})")].compact.join(" ") %>">
                  <div class="rounded-full ring-2 ring-surface shrink-0">
                    <%= render "components/agent_avatar", agent: entry, size: "sm" %>
                  </div>
                  <span class="text-sm text-heading flex flex-col items-center gap-1 min-w-0">
                    <span class="truncate max-w-[8rem]"><%= entry.name %></span>
                    <% if entry.weight.present? %>
                      <span class="shrink-0 px-1 py-px rounded text-[9px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide
                                   <%= entry.primary? ? "bg-primary/15 text-primary border border-primary/30" : "bg-surface-alt text-muted border border-subtle" %>"
                            title="<%= entry.primary? ? "Primary (deep) review" : "Light review" %>"><%= entry.role_label %></span>
                    <% end %>
                  </span>
                </div>
              <% end %>
            <% else %>
              <span class="self-center text-sm text-muted">&mdash;</span>
            <% end %>
          </div>

          <%# 3 — uniform metric block: Model · Tokens · Cost · Duration (— when not reported) %>
          <dl class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-3 gap-y-2 mb-3 text-xs" data-test="timeline-metrics">
            <div class="min-w-0">
              <dt class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wide text-muted">Model</dt>
              <dd class="font-mono text-secondary truncate" title="<%= block.model.presence %>"><%= block.model.presence || "—" %></dd>
            </div>
            <div class="min-w-0">
              <dt class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wide text-muted">Duration</dt>
              <dd class="text-secondary">
                <% if block.in_progress? && block.live_since %>
                  <%# Live ticker counting up every second: M:SS, switching to H:MM
                      once past 60 min. Formatted inline (NOT window.elapsedLabel,
                      which the board's coarser ticker shares) so only this card changes. %>
                  <span class="tabular-nums inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded
                               bg-green-500/15 border border-green-400/50 text-green-700 dark:text-green-200" data-test="timeline-live"
                        x-data="{ start: <%= block.live_since.to_i %>, now: Math.floor(Date.now() / 1000) }"
                        x-init="setInterval(() => now = Math.floor(Date.now() / 1000), 1000)">
                    &#9201; <span x-text="(() => { let e = Math.max(0, now - start); let h = Math.floor(e / 3600), m = Math.floor((e % 3600) / 60), s = e % 60; return h > 0 ? h + ':' + String(m).padStart(2, '0') : m + ':' + String(s).padStart(2, '0'); })()">…</span>
                  </span>
                <% elsif (spent = humanize_stage_duration(block.seconds)) %>
                  <%= spent %>
                <% else %>&mdash;<% end %>
              </dd>
            </div>
            <div class="min-w-0">
              <dt class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wide text-muted">Tokens</dt>
              <dd class="font-mono text-secondary tabular-nums"><%= block.tokens ? number_with_delimiter(block.tokens) : "—" %></dd>
            </div>
            <div class="min-w-0">
              <dt class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wide text-muted">Cost</dt>
              <dd class="font-mono text-secondary tabular-nums"><%= block.cost.present? ? "~$#{format("%.2f", block.cost)}" : "—" %></dd>
            </div>
          </dl>

          <%# 4 — footer: Started → Completed (Started shows alone while live) + source %>
          <div class="mt-auto pt-2 border-t border-subtle flex items-end justify-between gap-2 text-[11px]">
            <div class="space-y-0.5 min-w-0">
              <% if block.in_progress? %>
                <div class="text-muted">Started <span class="text-secondary"><%= block.live_since&.strftime("%b %d, %H:%M") %></span></div>
              <% else %>
                <% if started_at %>
                  <div class="text-muted">Started <span class="text-secondary"><%= started_at.strftime("%b %d, %H:%M") %></span></div>
                <% end %>
                <% if block.occurred_at %>
                  <div class="text-muted">Completed <span class="text-secondary" title="<%= block.occurred_at.strftime("%b %d, %Y %H:%M") %>"><%= block.occurred_at.strftime("%b %d, %H:%M") %></span> · <%= time_ago_in_words(block.occurred_at) %> ago</div>
                <% end %>
              <% end %>
            </div>
            <% if block.source.present? %>
              <span class="shrink-0 text-[10px] text-muted uppercase tracking-wide" title="How this transition was recorded"><%= block.source %></span>
            <% end %>
          </div>
        </li>
      <% end %>
    </ol>
  <% else %>
    <p class="text-sm text-muted">No stage changes recorded yet.</p>
  <% end %>
</div>
